# Beetle, Legacy Criminal (3/3 flier, {3}{U}): "{1}{U}, Exile this card from your graveyard: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature. It gains
# flying until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery." In turn 1 Black Lotus (UUU) and a Mox Ruby pay for Beetle, and Bot1's own Lightning
# Bolt (Mox Ruby) kills it (a 3/3 flier on the battlefield shows its Flying first). In turn 3 Bot1 draws Mox Sapphire; Sapphire and the third Ruby pay
# {1}{U} exactly. A Mox Pearl (not a creature) is refused, Bot2's Memnite is accepted and becomes a 2/2 flier, the Beetle card is exiled
# (CR 602.2, 400.7), and nothing is left in the pool. In turn 5 the flying is gone (until end of turn) while the counter stays.

